{
  "id": "io.github.parieses.calcsheet",
  "name": "计算稿纸",
  "version": "1.0.1",
  "description": "兼具草稿纸自由度与电子表格智能的多行计算工具，支持行号引用、变量定义、函数计算",
  "author": "QuickDock",
  "icon": "icon.svg",
  "category": "开发者日常",
  "platforms": ["windows"],
  "backend": {
    "runtime": "goja",
    "entry": "main.js"
  },
  "frontend": {
    "enabled": true,
    "entry": "frontend/index.html",
    "width": 780,
    "height": 560
  },
  "capabilities": [
    "command",
    "frontend"
  ],
  "permissions": {
    "network": false,
    "filesystem": true,
    "clipboard": true
  },
  "commands": [
    {
      "id": "open-calc",
      "title": "计算稿纸",
      "keywords": [
        "eval",
        "calc",
        "计算",
        "稿纸",
        "求值",
        "calcsheet",
        "算"
      ],
      "aliases": [
        "计算器",
        "jsq",
        "草稿纸"
      ],
      "matchPattern": "^[0-9+*/().%^, -]+$",
      "acceptsInput": true,
      "title_i18n": {
        "zh-CN": "计算稿纸",
        "en-US": "Calc Sheet"
      }
    }
  ],
  "name_i18n": {
    "zh-CN": "计算稿纸",
    "en-US": "Calc Sheet"
  },
  "description_i18n": {
    "zh-CN": "兼具草稿纸自由度与电子表格智能的多行计算工具，支持行号引用、变量定义、函数计算",
    "en-US": "Multi-line calculation tool combining scratchpad freedom with spreadsheet smarts: row references, variables, functions."
  },
  "changelog": "## v1.0.1\n\n- 图标改用统一 64 网格满幅圆角贴片 + 白色图形，线宽归一\n- 新增浅色主题图标 `icon.light.svg`，随应用主题自动切换\n\n## v1.0.0\n\n- 兼具草稿纸自由度与电子表格智能的多行计算工具，支持行号引用、变量定义、函数计算"
}
